"%(what)s would take stock below zero:\n"
"\n"
"%(rows)s\n"
"\n"
"Receive or correct the stock first, or ask someone with the \"Allow Negative Stock\" right to do it."
msgstr ""
"%(what)s ombor qoldig'ini manfiyga olib keladi:\n"
"\n"
"%(rows)s\n"
"\n"
"Avval tovarni kirim qiling yoki qoldiqni to'g'rilang, aks holda \"Manfiy qoldiqqa ruxsat\" huquqiga ega xodimdan so'rang."

